  "title": "similarweb 关键词列表数据如何免费导出并让AI分析做SEO优化？",
  "author": "银河星游",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/jo6ykk060w_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [],
  "content": "<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">快速导出数据</h1>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/jo6ykk060w_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\nsimilar web 数据导出要积分，怎么办？\n下载chrome插件：\n<a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/table-extractor/bplejbaicgjafneipkgikahgengigkpe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/table-extractor/bplejbaicgjafneipkgikahgengigkpe</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/jo6ykk060w_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n支持导出json，markdown，csv格式！</div>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">如何分析并优化SEO</h1>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">安装agents</h2>\n<div>参考小排老师的这篇文章：一键让你的Claude Code拥有所有世界顶级Agent，并卷死它自己\n直接对claude code说：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">https</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>github</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>wshobson</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>agents \n</span><span>把这些Agents 全部安装到我的 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">ClaudeCodeCLI里</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> 跳过重复的</span></code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">开始分析</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>将刚才的json或者csv格式的文件放到cc里面，@下文件路径</li>\n<li>“我现在要改善我的网站的SEO，请你查看@这个文件，这是竞品的关键词数据，我希望你调用agents来分析，现在请你给我agents调用方案，有什么需要我决策的请和我说”</li>\n<li>然后确认方案后让cc优化！</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">踩坑</h1>\n<div>一开始我试过油猴脚本，或者xpath，但是！！！都不好用！\n油猴脚本可能要不断适配similarweb\nxpath呢，要学习如何用，不太好整。\n而且这些都无法一键点击直接导出！\n后来搜半天试用了好多插件，终于找到一款好用的！\n爱了！</div>",
